<#
.SYNOPSIS
    Template for scripts/devserver.local.ps1 - your real dev SERVER box values.

.DESCRIPTION
    Copy this file to devserver.local.ps1 (same directory) and fill in your
    real values. devserver.local.ps1 is gitignored - it will never be
    committed.

    This file is dot-sourced by devserver.config.ps1 after $DevServer is
    defined with placeholders, so it just overwrites the fields that matter.
#>

$DevServer.Host    = "203.0.113.20"                                   # your dev server box's real address
$DevServer.HostKey = "SHA256:REPLACE-WITH-THE-REAL-HOST-KEY-FINGERPRINT"

# Uncomment and adjust if your setup differs from the defaults in devserver.config.ps1:
# $DevServer.User      = "sysadmin"
# $DevServer.RemoteDir = "/home/sysadmin/dev/nano-stack-7"
